      "description": "L1 source content this LAYER owns — the publications core's own vocabulary and methods are derived FROM, one `<bib-slug>/` per ingested document. Declared rather than borrowed because a method is placed by OWNERSHIP (`methodology-adoption` §4): a paper core's methodology cites from another instance's library would not lift out with it. Holds Doc-Researcher (`arxiv-2510.21603v1`), the C2PA Technical Specification 2.5 (`c2pa-2026-specification-2-5`, CC-BY-4.0) and the DSpace 7 REST Contract (`dspace-7-rest-contract`, BSD-3-Clause). `ingest-document.ts` refuses to guess a destination when several are declared. `dependents: skip` because these are THIS layer's sources; a downstream folio's library is its own.",
